     <H1 style="MARGIN: 0cm 89.35pt 0pt 88.7pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-width: 95%">绍兴市教育教学研究院关于<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></H1>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0.1pt 89.35pt 0pt 88.75pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions" align=center><FONT face=宋体><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑">组织 </SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>2017 </SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑">年市直教学研究评比的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑"><o:p><FONT face=宋体> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
