<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 13.8pt 12.1pt 0pt 11.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 142%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 142%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>为了进一步推进我市的课程改革，促进基础教育教学质量和<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt">中小学教师队伍专业水平的提升，本院将组织 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">2017</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt">年绍兴市直教</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">学研究评比活动，现将有关事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 44.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.95pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">一、教育教学论文评比<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></H2>
