pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -5.8pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">，其</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">余</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -0.75pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -7.35pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -11.55pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">份</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">不</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">署</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -11.55pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">名</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">）<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.55pt">和</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt">电</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt">子</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt">稿</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">（</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt">发</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt">送</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.85pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.55pt">各</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt">相</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt">关</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.55pt">联</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.3pt">系</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -11.55pt">人</SPAN><SPAN style="POSITION: relative; LETTER-SPACING: -4.8pt; TOP: 6pt; mso-text-raise: -6.0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -8.2pt">）</SPAN></SPAN><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei"'>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 5.25pt 14.15pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 35pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">． 坚持学术诚信， 严禁抄袭造假。参评论文须向市教研院相关联系人报送电子文档，若发现诚信缺失等问题，对责任人进行通报，并在三年内不予参加绍兴市直级及以上相关教学评比活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 38.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25.25pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">二、“品质课堂”录像课评比<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 7.25pt 0cm 0pt 37.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">． 内容要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 7.8pt 13.1pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 141%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 141%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">教学内容符合 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 141%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>2011 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 141%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">版课程标准要求，体现“品质课堂”的几</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 141%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">个要素</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 141%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 141%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">关注学科素养；关注学习状况；关注学习趣乐；关注问<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt">题思辨；关注实践体验；关注学习效果</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -8.15pt">）</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">，体现学科特点和信息技</SPAN>术应用的融合性，突出展现数字教育资源的课堂应用及如何利用信息技术和数字教育资源创新教学方法、有效解决教育教学的重<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">难点等课堂教学内容。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 2.3pt 0cm 0pt 37.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">． 评比形式<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 7.8pt 13.1pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 142%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 142%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>录像课评比即为“一师一优课、一课一名师”活动，各校所提交的“品质课堂”录像课评比材料应包括以下四项材料：一堂<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt">完整课的教学设计、所用课件及相关资源</SPAN>（<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">或资源链接</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -8.15pt">）</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt">、课堂实</SPAN>录（指教学过程视频）和评测练习（可选）等。课堂实录应展现课堂教学的所有内容，过程完整，画面清晰。建议进行适当的后期剪辑处理，在适当环节插入教学资源呈现画面，保证资源呈现画面清晰。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 2.15pt 0cm 0pt 37.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">． 评比时间。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 7.85pt 4.8pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">各校参评选手名单</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">（<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt">见附件 </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">）<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt">及相关参评材料<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>包括教学设</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.45pt">计、所用课件及相关资源、课堂实录和评测练习<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>需刻录在同一光</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt">盘，一式两份<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN>须在 </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>4 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">月 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>20 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">日前报本院相关学科教研员。评比主</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">题及要求由学科教研员根据省教研室“一师一优课、一课一名师” </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">活动的总体安排确定并通知。各学科根据工作要求组织评比，并<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">将评比结果在评比活动结束后一周内报送课程教研中心。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 2.65pt 0cm 0pt 37.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">． 评选科目及取奖数量上限<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 7.85pt 14.15pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">各校各学科推荐 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>1 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">节“品质课堂”录像课参加评比，各学科一、二等奖的比例为 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>4:6</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 135%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P> </P>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
